">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do we know if Sidereals if after Exigents? Also, I'm excited to see Across 8 Directions looks fairly far along! Very interested to see what they do with some of the new fluff like the Yennin and some of the old that wasn't touched on much in the core like Halta and the Haslanti.</div> </div> </div> </div>Last we heard the plan was Sids is after Exigents, with Getimians in roughly parallel development as a soft-cover length supplement. Then Abyssals after them, with Liminals in roughly parallel development as a soft-cover length supplement. I don\u2019t know if we\u2019ve heard explicitly what comes next, but I would assume Infernals and then Alchemicals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T11:02:14-07:00","id":1388365,"title":"","content":"All I heard was Sidereals after Exigents.<br /> <br /> Well, I guess it'll be Sidereals after the final version of Lunars, Heirs to the Shogunate, Across the Eight Directions, Crucible of Legend, Exigents, Many-Faced Strangers, Essence Edition, Hundred Devil's Night Parade, Adversaries of the Righteous...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T12:06:18-07:00","id":1388382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388266#post1388266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, have we ever got an official announcement or advert saying what is actually in it? I think bits have been said but not together.</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe it's in the vein of a DMG. So not only will it have some tips and suggestions about how to run a satisfying game, and how to use the rules best, but also, again like the DnD Dungeon Master Guide, will include some alternate versions of systems or tweaks that might suit your game better. I'm thinking specifically about the DMG's rest variants, alternate combat mechanics, and things like Honour and Madness.<br /> <br /> Not to say that the CoL will have those exactly but I did hear somewhere that the sail rules might get some optional variant rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T12:18:52-07:00","id":1388385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388382#post1388382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I believe it's in the vein of a DMG. So not only will it have some tips and suggestions about how to run a satisfying game, and how to use the rules best, but also, again like the DnD Dungeon Master Guide, will include some alternate versions of systems or tweaks that might suit your game better. I'm thinking specifically about the DMG's rest variants, alternate combat mechanics, and things like Honour and Madness.<br /> <br /> Not to say that the CoL will have those exactly but I did hear somewhere that the sail rules might get some optional variant rules.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, information and advice on storytelling the various Exalted, including the Getimian, Infernal and Alchemical splash pages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T12:25:24-07:00","id":1388388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388359#post1388359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fair enough. Is the Exigents fluff mostly finished-ish then?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm still on my first development pass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:49:13-07:00","id":1388895,"title":"","content":"Not like there's going to be a return of Onyx Path kickstarters yet, not in this economy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T07:05:31-07:00","id":1388924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388895#post1388895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not like there's going to be a return of Onyx Path kickstarters yet, not in this economy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Er, expand on that, please? 'Cause Onyx Path are still running Kickstarters, and they've got at least one non-WW KS slated (their own They Came From Beyond the Grave!).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T08:33:05-07:00","id":1388951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388895#post1388895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not like there's going to be a return of Onyx Path kickstarters yet, not in this economy.</div> </div> </div> </div>They cancelled Legendlore but right now they are running a kick starter for technocracy.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/m20-technocracy-reloaded\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...cracy-reloaded</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T08:37:03-07:00","id":1388953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388895#post1388895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not like there's going to be a return of Onyx Path kickstarters yet, not in this economy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't tell if this is literally sarcasm or you didn't notice the kickstarter they are halfway through.<br /> <br /> But I would have preferred they held off on doing this kickstarter rather then try to time it to coincide with stimulus checks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T08:38:59-07:00","id":1388954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388362#post1388362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Last we heard the plan was Sids is after Exigents, with Getimians in roughly parallel development as a soft-cover length supplement. Then Abyssals after them, with Liminals in roughly parallel development as a soft-cover length supplement. I don\u2019t know if we\u2019ve heard explicitly what comes next, but I would assume Infernals and then Alchemicals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Man Infernals is what I am most excited for, then Alchemicals, but they are both so late game.<br /> <br /> But its good that Exigents are just around the Corner because that book will fill a very vital niche in the 3rd ed Library both as worldbuilding tool and a Homebrew tool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date