\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T09:58:44-07:00","id":1388976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388895#post1388895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not like there's going to be a return of Onyx Path kickstarters yet, not in this economy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Technocracy is going strong. They suspended Legendlore, but it doesn't have a built in fan base the established lines do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-16-2020, 01:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T10:27:02-07:00","id":1388983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388975#post1388975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> we\u2019ll get Essence well before that point, so they\u2019ll be playable there.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but only if you want to change to a different system.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I'd like it if they put Abyssals ahead of SIdereal so that we can go ahead and get an actual fleshed out necromancy system instead of one of the 4 ways for an exalt to get power outside their usual purview being homebrew still.<br /> <br /> <hr /></div> </div> </div> </div>My guess is that they figured that Abyssals are much easier to homebrew (take Solar charms, make them dark and edgy) than Sidereals.<br /> <br /> Or it may just be that Vance is really hyped to do Sidereals, tbh. (Which isn't necessarily a bad thing, because generally it increases quality.)<br /> <br /> I am sure that Abyssals will be after that. IIRC, Vance said he feels that the game doesn't feel &quot;complete&quot; unless there are rules for Solars, Lunars, Dragonblood, Sidereals and Abyssals (he called them the &quot;big five&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T10:27:48-07:00","id":1388984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388976#post1388976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Technocracy is going strong. They suspended Legendlore, but it doesn't have a built in fan base the established lines do.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I think when people are not so sure about spending money, kickstarting something with a solid fanbase is going to be much more successful than a new product.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T11:13:17-07:00","id":1388993,"title":"","content":"Question about Exigents<br /> <br /> What is the unifying theme of Exigents other than that they are Exalted whose patrons are regular gods rather than Incarnae?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T11:14:06-07:00","id":1388994,"title":"","content":"Also, \u201cexigent\u201d means emergency. Not sure if that\u2019s relevant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T11:38:23-07:00","id":1389011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388993#post1388993\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the unifying theme of Exigents other than that they are Exalted whose patrons are regular gods rather than Incarnae?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that's it, really. Every Exigent is different, including a wide range of potential power levels, from &quot;only as powerful as a Dragon-Blooded&quot; up to &quot;Almost as potent as a Solar&quot;, and a staggering variety of possible themes and powers. Really, Exigents exist, at least in part, in order to let people do more customization and homebrewing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388994#post1388994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, \u201cexigent\u201d means emergency. Not sure if that\u2019s relevant.</div> </div> </div> </div>That ties to their creation, apparently - the thing that allows a god to create an Exalt, the Exigent Fire, is supposed to be handed out to address a specific situation, a problem that only an Exalt can solve. Every Exigence was created when some god petitioned the Unconquered Sun to say &quot;I have a big problem, and I need a mortal champion!&quot;, and the Unconquered Sun agreed that the situation did deserve such power. Not every Exigence actually gets <i>used</i> that way, mind - we know there's a trade in &quot;black market&quot; Exigences, where the god who was originally granted it doesn't use it for that, but instead passes it along to someone else in exchange for other power and favors. Those black market Exigences could get used a variety of ways that are much less urgent, or particularly moral. And, of course, once an Exigent Exalted has been created, if they survive the crisis they were meant to deal with, they can go on and do other stuff - just like the other Exalted, really, who were created for the Divine Revolution, but lasted much longer, with significant consequences for the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T11:41:15-07:00","id":1389013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1388983#post1388983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My guess is that they figured that Abyssals are much easier to homebrew (take Solar charms, make them dark and edgy) than Sidereals.<br /> <br /> Or it may just be that Vance is really hyped to do Sidereals, tbh. (Which isn't necessarily a bad thing, because generally it increases quality.)<br /> <br /> I am sure that Abyssals will be after that. IIRC, Vance said he feels that the game doesn't feel &quot;complete&quot; unless there are rules for Solars, Lunars, Dragonblood, Sidereals and Abyssals (he called them the &quot;big five&quot;).</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm more of an Abyssals fan than a Sidereals fan, but I pushed for Sidereals to come first. This is indeed in large part because Abyssals are easier to homebrew than Sidereals. But it's also because the material to be addressed in Sidereals are more closely tied in with other splats than Abyssals \u2014 the Bronze Faction's involvement with the Wyld Hunt ties them in with Solars, Dragon-Blooded, and Lunars, while the complexities of the Celestial Bureaucracy are more relevant to the average game set in Creation than the hierarchies of the Underworld. And while it's a much less significant concern, the shared relevance of gods to both Sidereals and Exigents means we can focus on the divine in adjacent splat books (and hopefully in softbacks we're pitching to develop around that time) in a way that's useful to both,<br /> <br /> The material we intend to cover in the Abyssals book is still important to cross-splat play! Shadowlands, the Underworld, and the undead are useful setting tools in any game; necromancy is of interest to various sorts of Exalted; and Lunars can get interesting narrative opportunities out of a Solar mate turned Abyssal. So we're hoping to put Abyssals right after Sidereals in the schedule.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":1120,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","user":"Eric Minton","date":". 05-16-2020, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T12:17:00-07:00","id":1389031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1389013#post1389013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But it's also because the material to be addressed in Sidereals are more closely tied in with other splats than Abyssals \u2014 the Bronze Faction's involvement with the Wyld Hunt ties them in with Solars, Dragon-Blooded, and Lunars, while the complexities of the Celestial Bureaucracy are more relevant to the average game set in Creation than the hierarchies of the Underworld.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can see the logic there.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And while it's a much less significant concern, the shared relevance of gods to both Sidereals and Exigents means we can focus on the divine in adjacent splat books (and hopefully in softbacks we're pitching to develop around that time) in a way that's useful to both, </div> </div> </div>I think I remember you saying you were hoping to do a Gods+Demons+Religions book some time after Exigents before? I would very much like a Cults of Creation (but with a snappier name) book. And we can always do with more demons.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The material we intend to cover in the Abyssals book is still important to cross-splat play! Shadowlands, the Underworld, and the undead are useful setting tools in any game; necromancy is of interest to various sorts of Exalted; and Lunars can get interesting narrative opportunities out of a Solar mate turned Abyssal. So we're hoping to put Abyssals right after Sidereals in the schedule. </div> </div> </div>Makes sense to me.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T12:31:21-07:00","id":1389035,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I can understand why it is being arranged this way given the setting impact for it is going to be more likely to come up in most games. I am just biased because personally I find the stuff traditionally associated with abyssals like the underworld and necromancy a more interesting concept then Yu-Shan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T12:46:17-07:00","id":1389040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1389031#post1389031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I remember you saying you were hoping to do a Gods+Demons+Religions book some time after Exigents before? I would very much like a Cults of Creation (but with a snappier name) book. And we can always do with more demons.</div> </div> </div> </div>We are hoping to put out such a book after <i>Exigents</i>, but nothing's been approved as yet. Such a book would cover demons only in passing to address demon cults. More extensive discussion of demons would be reserved for <i>Infernals</i> and for a hypothetical book on sorcery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T12:51:22-07:00","id":1389044,"title":"","content":"Yeah, you've got plenty of books in the pipeline, and I guess Exigents won't be out until at least the second half of 2021.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 05-16-2020, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T12:56:45-07:00","id":1389048,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1533_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1533\" data-vbnamecard=\"1533\">Kelly Pedersen</a> that sounds really cool.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1120_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1120\" data-vbnamecard=\"1120\">Eric Minton</a> what happened to a book called Paths of Brigid? I saw it on the upcoming product list like ages ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T13:20:38-07:00","id":1389052,"title":"","content":"Let's not forget that necromancy is even easier to &quot;homebrew&quot; than Abyssals: pick a 2spooky shaping ritual, take the spells from <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/293257/Adversaries-of-the-Righteous-The-Prince-Resplendent-and-Gleaming-Gneiss\" target=\"_blank\">the Prince Resplendent</a>, and paint any other spells you want black.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T13:21:29-07:00","id":1389053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1389048#post1389048\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1120_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1120\" data-vbnamecard=\"1120\">Eric Minton</a> what happened to a book called Paths of Brigid? I saw it on the upcoming product list like ages ago.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was a book pitch by the previous development team that didn't materialize before the changeover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T13:47:23-07:00","id":1389060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1389052#post1389052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's not forget that necromancy is even easier to &quot;homebrew&quot; than Abyssals: pick a 2spooky shaping ritual, take the spells from <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/293257/Adversaries-of-the-Righteous-The-Prince-Resplendent-and-Gleaming-Gneiss\" target=\"_blank\">the Prince Resplendent</a>, and paint any other spells you want black.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;Just throw some black paint on sorcery spells&quot; is easy enough that even someone as crunch weak as me can do it but it also makes me feel like I am just playing a sorcerer who is trying to be an edge lord instead of someone who has mastered a different sort of power entirely. Which is still better then not being able to play one at all, granted. And I am too cheap to buy any of those until they are combined into a full book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T14:14:47-07:00","id":1389067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1389044#post1389044\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, you've got plenty of books in the pipeline, and I guess Exigents won't be out until at least the second half of 2021.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait what? You mean the complete release or the backer preview they usually do before the official release when you guess at a second half 2021 release?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T14:23:11-07:00","id":1389069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1389040#post1389040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We are hoping to put out such a book after <i>Exigents</i>, but nothing's been approved as yet. Such a book would cover demons only in passing to address demon cults. More extensive discussion of demons would be reserved for <i>Infernals</i> and for a hypothetical book on sorcery.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. It's been so long, I never considered the idea that Infernals from the outset means that they serve as the Edition's very introduction to Hell.<br /> <br /> That... probably solves a lot of problems all in its own...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T14:49:58-07:00","id":1389074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1388001-exigents-has-moved-from-second-draft-to-development?p=1389067#post1389067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait what? You mean the complete release or the backer preview they usually do before the official release when you guess at a second half 2021 release?</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean that, as it's currently in the Development stage, I expect Exigents to get a kickstarter in the second half of this year. From kickstarter to final release generally seems to take about a year.<br /> <br /> I could be wrong of course. This is just my ballpark guess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}